## Review Requirements

### Standard Flow
1. Owner(s) review via GitHub pull requests
2. Minimum 1 approval from owner team
3. Additional approval needed if critical path affected

### Fast Track
- Documentation-only changes: 1 reviewer suffices
- Trivial fixes (typos, formatting): Auto-approved after 12h if no objections

### Escalation Path
If primary owners unresponsive > 48h:
1. Tag alternative reviewer from same domain
2. Escalate to engineering manager if still blocked

## Adding New Owners

To add or remove code owners:
1. Submit PR modifying this file
2. Require approval from:
   - Current owner(s) 
   - Engineering manager
   - Product lead (for user-facing components)

## Best Practices

- Use descriptive team emails over individual handles where possible
- Update promptly when staff roles change
- Keep contact methods current and monitored
- Document escalation procedures in wiki

